{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54348","headline":"读书台 · 欧阳董","name":"读书台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐上沿江碧玉流，读书人住几春秋。\n尘埃青竹阴连栋，风雨黄茅冷盖头。\n一榻螙鱼今槁死，千年别鹤旧经游。\n吾方晓夜遥山梦，世事从今只钓舟。\n（见清曾燠编《江西诗徵》卷三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳董","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}